{"text":"Back home, sixty-six million years from now, it's day fifty. On the first morning, your mom knocked to wake you for school. No answer. Your door was locked from the inside. A neighbour had to break it open. The bed was empty. The window was shut. The police still can't explain it. There's a poster on every lamp post in town. Your face. MISSING. Your mom hasn't moved a thing in your room. Your dad's dinosaur posters.","mood":"story","settings":{"stability":0.3,"style":0.6,"speed":1.1},"alignment":{"characters":["B","a","c","k"," ","h","o","m","e",","," ","s","i","x","t","y","-","s","i","x"," ","m","i","l","l","i","o","n"," ","y","e","a","r","s"," ","f","r","o","m"," ","n","o","w",","," ","i","t","'","s"," ","d","a","y"," ","f","i","f","t","y","."," ","O","n"," ","t","h","e"," ","f","i","r","s","t"," ","m","o","r","n","i","n","g",","," ","y","o","u","r"," ","m","o","m"," ","k","n","o","c","k","e","d"," ","t","o"," ","w","a","k","e"," ","y","o","u"," ","f","o","r"," ","s","c","h","o","o","l","."," ","N","o"," ","a","n","s","w","e","r","."," ","Y","o","u","r"," ","d","o","o","r"," ","w","a","s"," ","l","o","c","k","e","d"," ","f","r","o","m"," ","t","h","e"," ","i","n","s","i","d","e","."," ","A"," ","n","e","i","g","h","b","o","u","r"," ","h","a","d"," ","t","o"," ","b","r","e","a","k"," ","i","t"," ","o","p","e","n","."," ","T","h","e"," ","b","e","d"," ","w","a","s"," ","e","m","p","t","y","."," ","T","h","e"," ","w","i","n","d","o","w"," ","w","a","s"," ","s","h","u","t","."," ","T","h","e"," ","p","o","l","i","c","e"," ","s","t","i","l","l"," ","c","a","n","'","t"," ","e","x","p","l","a","i","n"," ","i","t","."," ","T","h","e","r","e","'","s"," ","a"," ","p","o","s","t","e","r"," ","o","n"," ","e","v","e","r","y"," ","l","a","m","p"," ","p","o","s","t"," ","i","n"," ","t","o","w","n","."," ","Y","o","u","r"," ","f","a","c","e","."," ","M","I","S","S","I","N","G","."," ","Y","o","u","r"," ","m","o","m"," ","h","a","s","n","'","t"," ","m","o","v","e","d"," "